        "text": {
            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-METRO-PC\"><b>Laurey Metro Polished Chrome Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Polished Chrome Metro Cabinet Pull is available in a wide array of lengths to suit any kitchen remodel project. This modern cabinet handle is easy to clean and easy to install. The Laurey Metro Polished Chrome Cabinet Pull features a sleek grip to add style to any lightweight door or drawer.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey Metro Polished Chrome Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Polished Chrome</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 5 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LAU-41026:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 3-3/4\" (96mm)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-41126:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 5\" (128mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-41226:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 6-1/4\" (160mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-41326:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 7-1/2\" (192mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 7-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-41426:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 10\" (256mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
